  "details": "23015 \"Cloth Max Vertices\" is one of the categories on MM > Avatar details > Performance Breakdown\n\nHowever, in the doc ( https://creators.vrchat.com/avatars/avatar-performance-ranking-system ) the category is labeled \"Total Cloth Vertices\". (Note, you can see the limit value of Poor 200 on both.)\n\nI think these expressions must be matched exactly. I suggest revising the string to be \"Total Cloth Vertices\"\n\n(BTW, Doesn't this category work now? https://feedback.vrchat.com/bug-reports/p/1260-cloth-vertices-not-tracking )",
